  <item>
    <title>《三言二拍》：杜十娘投江之打死不做恋爱脑</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ac61033f2273579c50b627d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ac61033f2273579c50b627d</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 07 Oct 2026 09:04:46 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播：潘采夫</span></p><p><span>嘉宾：刘晓蕾</span></p><br><br><p><span>如果把时间拨回明代，《三言二拍》大概就是那个时代的“爆款短剧”。</span></p><p><span>它是冯梦龙“三言”与凌濛初“二拍”五部白话短篇小说集的合称。故事不写庙堂之高，而是扎进市井生活：爱情、婚姻、金钱、欲望、背叛、骗局与人情世故。书生、商人、妓女、官吏和普通百姓轮番登场，情节密集、反转不断，既狗血，又真实，几百年前就已经把人性里的贪嗔痴拍得明明白白。</span></p><p><span>而《杜十娘怒沉百宝箱》，就是其中最经典、也最令人唏嘘的一则。</span></p><p><span>潘老师提到的曲剧：</span></p><p><span><a data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1yt411k7aY/?spm_id_from=333.788.videopod.episodes&amp;vd_source=fd44ba3dd0468258bd7a9dc9a9050220&amp;p=2" href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1yt411k7aY/?spm_id_from=333.788.videopod.episodes&amp;vd_source=fd44ba3dd0468258bd7a9dc9a9050220&amp;p=2">www.bilibili.com</a></span></p><br><br><br>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://jt.ximalaya.com//GKwRIUEOm87EAgeQHQTj3QU3.m4a?channel=rss&amp;album_id=14641355&amp;track_id=1021634801&amp;uid=107676902&amp;jt=https://aod.cos.tx.xmcdn.com/storages/442e-audiofreehighqps/40/63/GKwRIUEOm87EAgeQHQTj3QU3.m4a" length="34050077" type="audio/mp4"/>
